<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Light Cult Cryptonaut | Ron English Catalogue Raisonné</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../css/styles.css" />

  <style>
    :root{
      --border:#e5e7eb;
      --muted:#4b5563;
      --shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
      --radius:18px;
      --bg:#ffffff;
      --panel:#f3f4f6;
    }

    *{
      box-sizing:border-box;
    }

    html{
      scroll-behavior:smooth;
    }

    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
      color:#111;
      background:var(--bg);
      padding-left:0;
      padding-right:0;
    }

    .wrap{
      max-width:1100px;
      margin:0 auto;
      padding:28px 18px 60px;
    }

    .nav-pills{
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:10px;
      margin-top:22px;
      margin-bottom:22px;
    }

    .nav-pill{
      padding:8px 14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      background:#fff;
      color:#111;
      text-decoration:none;
      font-size:14px;
    }

    .nav-pill:hover{
      background:#f9fafb;
    }

    .page-header{
      max-width:1100px;
      margin:0 0 28px;
      padding:0;
      text-align:left;
    }

    .page-title{
      margin:0 0 10px;
      font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);
      letter-spacing:-.02em;
      line-height:1.05;
    }

    .section-card{
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      padding:22px;
      margin-bottom:24px;
    }

    .section-card h2{
      margin:0 0 8px;
      font-size:1.4rem;
    }

    .gallery-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
      gap:20px;
    }

    .originals-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));
      gap:20px;
    }

    .card-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
      gap:20px;
      margin-top:8px;
    }

    .gallery-item{
      display:block;
      text-decoration:none;
      color:inherit;
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:16px;
      overflow:hidden;
      transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
      box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
    }

    .gallery-item:hover{
      transform:translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    }

    .gallery-item img{
      display:block;
      width:100%;
      height:280px;
      object-fit:contain;
      background:var(--panel);
      padding:6px;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .originals-grid .gallery-item img{
      height:420px;
      background:var(--panel);
      padding:8px;
    }

    .card-grid .gallery-item img{
      height:520px;
      background:var(--panel);
      padding:10px;
    }

    .card-text-block{
      margin-top:20px;
      padding:18px;
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:14px;
      background:var(--panel);
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:minmax(240px,0.95fr) minmax(280px,1.05fr);
      gap:24px;
      align-items:start;
    }

    .card-column{
      min-width:0;
    }

    .text-label{
      display:block;
      font-size:.78rem;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.08em;
      color:var(--muted);
      margin-bottom:8px;
    }

    .card-details{
      display:grid;
      gap:8px;
    }

    .card-detail{
      margin:0;
      line-height:1.55;
    }

    .poem{
      margin:0;
      white-space:pre-line;
      color:#111;
      line-height:1.65;
    }

    .back-link{
      margin-top:28px;
    }

    .back-link a{
      display:inline-block;
      text-decoration:none;
      color:#111;
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:999px;
      padding:10px 16px;
      background:#fff;
    }

    .back-link a:hover{
      background:#f9fafb;
    }

    @media (max-width:760px){
      .card-text-block{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width:640px){
      .wrap{
        padding:22px 14px 50px;
      }

      .gallery-item img{
        height:240px;
      }

      .originals-grid .gallery-item img{
        height:320px;
      }

      .card-grid .gallery-item img{
        height:420px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <nav class="nav-pills" aria-label="Site navigation">
      <a class="nav-pill" href="https://ronenglish-archive.github.io/ron-english-catalogue-raisonne/">Catalogue home</a>
      <a class="nav-pill" href="../index.html">Sketches</a>
      <a class="nav-pill" href="index.html">Aliens</a>
    </nav>

    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">Light Cult Cryptonaut</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="section-card" aria-labelledby="original-sketches">
      <h2 id="original-sketches">Original Drawings</h2>

      <div class="originals-grid">
        <a class="gallery-item" href="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 1 original.jpg">
          <img src="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 1 original.jpg" alt="Light Cult Cryptonaut pose 1 original sketch by Ron English" loading="lazy" />
        </a>

        <a class="gallery-item" href="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 2 original.jpg">
          <img src="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 2 original.jpg" alt="Light Cult Cryptonaut pose 2 original sketch by Ron English" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-card" aria-labelledby="digitized-versions">
      <h2 id="digitized-versions">Digitized Versions</h2>

      <div class="gallery-grid">
        <a class="gallery-item" href="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 1 B&W.jpg">
          <img src="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 1 B&W.jpg" alt="Light Cult Cryptonaut pose 1 digitized black-and-white version by Ron English" loading="lazy" />
        </a>

        <a class="gallery-item" href="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 2 B&W.jpg">
          <img src="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 2 B&W.jpg" alt="Light Cult Cryptonaut pose 2 digitized black-and-white version by Ron English" loading="lazy" />
        </a>

        <a class="gallery-item" href="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 3 B&W.jpg">
          <img src="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 3 B&W.jpg" alt="Light Cult Cryptonaut pose 3 digitized black-and-white version by Ron English" loading="lazy" />
        </a>

        <a class="gallery-item" href="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 1 color.jpg">
          <img src="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 1 color.jpg" alt="Light Cult Cryptonaut pose 1 digitized color version by Ron English" loading="lazy" />
        </a>

        <a class="gallery-item" href="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 2 color.jpg">
          <img src="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 2 color.jpg" alt="Light Cult Cryptonaut pose 2 digitized color version by Ron English" loading="lazy" />
        </a>

        <a class="gallery-item" href="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 3 color.jpg">
          <img src="../../images/Sketches/aliens/Light Cult Cryptonaut - pose 3 color.jpg" alt="Light Cult Cryptonaut pose 3 digitized color version by Ron English" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-card" aria-labelledby="trading-card">
      <h2 id="trading-card">Trading Card</h2>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <a class="gallery-item" href="../../images/Sketches/aliens 2/cryptonaut card 1.jpg">
          <img src="../../images/Sketches/aliens 2/cryptonaut card 1.jpg" alt="Light Cult Cryptonaut trading card image 1" loading="lazy" />
        </a>

        <a class="gallery-item" href="../../images/Sketches/aliens 2/cryptonaut card 2.jpg">
          <img src="../../images/Sketches/aliens 2/cryptonaut card 2.jpg" alt="Light Cult Cryptonaut trading card image 2" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="card-text-block">
        <div class="card-column">
          <span class="text-label">Card details</span>
          <div class="card-details">
            <p class="card-detail"><strong>Series:</strong> 1</p>
            <p class="card-detail"><strong>Number:</strong> 34</p>
            <p class="card-detail"><strong>Affiliation:</strong> Aliens</p>
            <p class="card-detail"><strong>Occupation:</strong> Light provider</p>
            <p class="card-detail"><strong>Preoccupation:</strong> Being the light of the world</p>
            <p class="card-detail"><strong>Virtue:</strong> He is the light</p>
            <p class="card-detail"><strong>Vice:</strong> He keeps us up at night</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-column">
          <span class="text-label">Poem</span>
          <p class="poem">Deep in the darkest corner of paradise,
There's an open door
With a blinding light.
An eternal memory, a second sight,
The moon's reflection
Of the sun's bright night.
Light Cult Cryptonaut
May be Orion's acolyte,
Or the devil's difference
Between black and white.
Is he our courage? Is he our right?
Is he our hope? Is he our blight?
Is he the darkness? Is he the light?
Be the light!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="back-link">
      <a href="index.html">← Back to Aliens</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
